    {
      "text": "Namespaces are the areas in which tags for Microsegmentation are created. You can create your own custom namespaces or allow machine learning (ML) and cloud namespaces to be generated from your organization's data. You can edit or delete custom namespaces at any time."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Prerequisites",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Enable policy enforcement for your organization. To learn more, see Enabling Microsegmentation Policy Settings."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Configuring Custom Namespaces",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To configure a custom namespace for a tag:"
    },
    {
      "item": "From the navigation menu, go to Zero Trust Cloud > Microsegmentation > Tag Management.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          32,
          48
        ],
        [
          51,
          68
        ],
        [
          71,
          85
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click the + icon to add a custom namespace.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          10,
          11
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "The Add Namespace drawer opens.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          17
